 A new model is a row in model_deck/core.py models(); a new harness a row in HARNESSES.
 
+**Bonsai 2.5** uses PrismML's `Q2_0-mtp` weights on the secondary drive (hover the row for
+the path). The text server uses the RX 7900 XTX, a 64K context, one slot, three MTP draft
+tokens and `xhigh` reasoning. Its built-in chat is at http://127.0.0.1:8080/ while it runs.
+On November 25 the Model Deck service read an 8,835-token Python prompt at 955 tokens/s and
+generated 256 tokens at 102 tokens/s. Total GPU use was about 11.6 GiB.
